Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.44,0:22:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs58.5\}我想你 我想你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.34,0:22:02.99,OP-ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fs54\c&H47FF75&}I need you   I need you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.34,0:22:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs58.5\}我要你 我要你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.47,0:22:05.33,OP-ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fs54\c&H47FF75&}Sexy Sexy
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.47,0:22:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs58.5\}性感 迷人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.64,0:22:17.34,OP-ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fs54\c&H47FF75&}ねぇ 部屋にこない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.64,0:22:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs58.5\}呐 不来房里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.97,0:22:25.27,OP-ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fs54\c&H47FF75&}ナイショのハナシ 聞かせてあげる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.97,0:22:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs58.5\}有悄悄话 想对你说
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.72,0:22:34.20,OP-ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fs54\c&H47FF75&}ふらちな夜に心も濡れた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.72,0:22:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs58.5\}无情之夜 心已湿透
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.01,0:22:37.88,OP-ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fs54\c&H47FF75&}時はもどせない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.01,0:22:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,, {\fs58.5\}机不可失
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.22,0:22:40.39,OP-ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fs54\c&H47FF75&}Come back  Come back Come back
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.22,0:22:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs58.5\}回来 来吧 快来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.93,0:22:47.91,OP-ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fs54\c&H47FF75&}情熱の かなたから蜃気楼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.93,0:22:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs58.5\}情热的海市蜃楼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.94,0:22:50.43,OP-ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fs54\c&H47FF75&}揺らして 揺らして
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.94,0:22:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs58.5\}摇晃着 摇晃着
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.70,0:22:52.23,OP-ED JP,,0,0,0,,{\fs54\c&H47FF75&}揺らして 揺らして
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.70,0:22:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs58.5\}摇荡着 摇荡着
